 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Illusive Mirage — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>Due to your mastery of Reverse Cursed Technique, you have learned your cursed technique reversal. You are now able to make the distorted faces real. As an action for 4 cursed energy, you can distort a creature's face that is distorted for a cursed creature. The creature must make a CE saving throw. On a failure, their face is distorted and they have disadvantage on Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma checks and saves and lose concentration on any technique or feature it was concentrating on. After failing, a creature may repeat the saves at the end of their turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>",
